            "body": "Fictional, nonconfidential executed operating log. At 2026-01-01T00:01:30Z (synthetic second 90), the upstream pressure-control valve setpoint was reduced from 80.0 to 79.25 bar. Execution was acknowledged at second 100 and the log became available at second 110. Hydraulic scope is Trunk P1 and downstream Branch A P2 and Branch B P3, all four stations on each segment. This entry records a commanded change, not measured pressure at the taps. Expected broad pressure response remains a hypothesis to compare against actual pre/post pressure histories from independent gateways; coincident localized behavior is not excluded.",
