            "id": "PROC-INSPECT-001",
            "body": "Fictional, nonconfidential procedure. The desk assessment uses pressure timing, persistence, coverage and paired taps to scope uncertainty before any inspection recommendation. Trunk P1, Branch A P2 and Branch B P3 each have ST1 through ST4 with A/B pressure taps; ST1/ST3 share gateway-<segment>-0 and ST2/ST4 share gateway-<segment>-1. Agreement within a shared gateway is not independent telemetry corroboration. A bounded inspection area requires support from distinct stations and gateways, with exclusions and missing observers recorded. Operating logs and maintenance history are context, not proof of an integrity condition. Incomplete log coverage cannot establish that no operation occurred. Physical intervention remains subject to operator authorization.",
